VOICE:
- English narration synthesized offline with Kokoro-82M (kokoro-onnx, Apache-2.0),
  voice "bm_george", speed 0.92. Every line verified by faster-whisper speech-to-text (base.en).
  https://github.com/thewh1tekle/kokoro-onnx — Apache License 2.0
- Speech check: faster-whisper (MIT) with the base.en model.

MUSIC & SOUND:
- All music and foley synthesized procedurally in numpy for this film (mix.py): drone,
  heartbeat kick, marimba-style pluck, music-box bell, pizzicato bass, pads, hats, snaps,
  wave/rain/room beds, stamp/shutter/paper/typewriter/drawer foley. No third-party samples.

TOOLS (pipeline):
- Lemo-Opuscar core tools (rendering, TTS, ASR check, SRT, mux) — MIT Licence,
  https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar
- Playwright chromium-headless-shell (Apache-2.0), ffmpeg (LGPL/GPL), Python scientific stack
  (numpy BSD, soundfile LGPL-2.1, soxr LGPL-2.1, Pillow HPND).

SUBTITLE RENDERING:
- Burned-in caption bars are drawn by the film engine; somerton-man.srt generated from the
  same cue data (core/render/srt.py).

